echnology - Voiced by Guy Harris - www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Land of Eyas Voiceover"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Land of Eyas Voiceover, An unusual game playing around with the physics of gaming technology</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[null,null]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Another video game trailer for me</h2>\r\n<p>I voice a lot of game trailers across Xbox, Play Station, PC, and mobile platforms. So many great games are being made every week and good developers (with good marketing teams) know that they need to make a game trailer with a high production value. This is where I come in, as voiceover is the most important part of any game trailer. Otherwise, it's just footage from the game... If you'd like to check out my voice on some other game trailers, watch the <a href=\"/warwings-game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warwings\">Warwings</a>, and <a href=\"/worms-wmd-character-voices\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Worms WMD\">Worms WMD</a> game trailers.</p>\r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/439KyoB033w","title":"Land of Eyas Voiceover","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-card","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/land-of-eyas-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Land of Eyas Voiceover","className":"blog-post-img"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-post-img-caption","children":"Land of Eyas Voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>A little more about Land of Eyas</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/299800/The_Land_of_Eyas/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Land of Eyas\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Land of Eyas</a> is a Steam and Xbox game that plays with gravity, and physics in general, in many different ways. This is very much a game built for big fans of the platform and action adventure genres. It's a game for people who've played lots of these kinds of games and want something fresh that distorts and plays with the genre in several clever ways. It was great fun providing a slightly eccentric voiceover for this trailer, but then this seems appropriate as the game is more than a little eccentric itself!</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for this voice style for your next <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailer</a>? Please get in touch. I'd be very happy to send a short sample of your script to you before you book me. Please send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I'm right for your brand. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Land of Eyas Voiceover","pageUrl":"land-of-eyas-voiceover"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-re